<title>SPAIN: Madrid bourse close delayed for technical reasons.</title>
<headline>Madrid bourse close delayed for technical reasons.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Madrid bourse's close was delayed due to technical problems just before the end of session on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are deciding whether to reopen the session or make the final price quotes (before the technical problems) official,&quot; said a spokesman from the stock market's governing body.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2167</p>
